---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { BASE_URL, REPO } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Benchmarks: Compass"
  description="Compass benchmark results: semantic search p50 0.11ms, 2,000 vectors added in 158ms, embeddings 3–15ms on-device. Numbers we measured, not numbers we hope for."
  canonical={`${BASE_URL}/benchmarks`}
>
  <section class="page-hero" style="text-align:center">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="section-kicker reveal">Benchmarks</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Numbers we measured, not numbers we hope for.</h1>
      <p class="reveal" style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--text-dim);max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.7">
        Every metric below comes from <code>./run.sh benchmark</code>, a test suite that runs the
        <strong>real app code</strong> (real FAISS bridge, real vector store, real embedding
        models), not mocks. Run it on your own machine; the command is in the repo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal glass" style="padding:28px;overflow-x:auto">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9rem">
          <thead>
            <tr style="text-align:left;color:var(--text-faint)">
              <th style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)">Metric</th>
              <th style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)">Value</th>
              <th style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)">What it means</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">vector.search_p50_ms</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)"><strong>0.11 ms</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-dim)">Semantic search, median (2,000-vector HNSW index)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">vector.search_p95_ms</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)"><strong>0.46 ms</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-dim)">Semantic search, 95th percentile</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">vector.add_2000_ms</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)"><strong>157.7 ms</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-dim)">2,000 entries added to the real FAISS store (0.08 ms/entry)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">ram.vector_store_growth_mb</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)"><strong>8.08 MB</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-dim)">Footprint growth for 2,000 vectors + metadata</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">file.read_300_files_ms</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)"><strong>6.3 ms</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-dim)">300 files read from disk (editor open-path proxy)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)">Embeddings (on-device, ANE)</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px"><strong>3.2 / 7.4 / 15.0 ms</strong></td>
              <td style="padding:10px 14px;color:var(--text-dim)">bge-small (384d) / bge-base (768d) / bge-large (1024d), avg per embedding</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-faint);margin-top:14px;text-align:center">
        Baseline: M4 MacBook Pro, 2026-08-03, Debug build. Full methodology and regression gates:
        <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/BENCHMARKS.md`} style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline">BENCHMARKS.md</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="section-kicker reveal">Why these KPIs</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">The numbers our users actually care about</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:16px">
        <div class="reveal card">
          <h3 style="font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px">RAM: the founding story</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim)">
            Compass exists because Cursor + Docker ate a 16GB MacBook. Footprint and growth are
            tracked like bugs: 8 MB for 2,000 semantic entries, and we publish the delta because
            bloat is a bug.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal card">
          <h3 style="font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px">Search latency: retrieval must feel instant</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim)">
            RAG quality is worthless if retrieval feels slow. Sub-millisecond at 2,000 entries;
            the target is sub-10ms at 1,000,000. The index grows; the latency shouldn't.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal card">
          <h3 style="font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px">Embedding latency: the Neural Engine promise</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim)">
            All bundled models must stay under 100 ms per embedding. Current: 3–15 ms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="section-kicker reveal">On the bench</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Next metrics, in the open</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:12px">
        <div class="reveal card" style="padding:18px 22px">
          <h3 style="font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px">FIM completion latency (p50/p95)</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim)">
            The <strong>&lt;100ms</strong> claim, measured with the real 4B on-device model:
            time-to-first-token, prompt tokens/sec, generation tokens/sec, RSS before/after load.
            The metrics struct already exists in the harness; the run needs the model download
            and the stable merge. This is the marquee number; we won't publish it until we've
            actually measured it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal card" style="padding:18px 22px">
          <h3 style="font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px">Startup-to-ready · index time · standalone app RAM</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim)">
            Launch → window usable; first + incremental index of a 100k-LOC repo; Release-build
            idle footprint. All queued, all published the moment they're measured.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="reveal" style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px;color:var(--text-dim)">
        Benchmarks run on every release and on demand. See the
        <a href={`${REPO}/actions/workflows/benchmark.yml`} style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline">Benchmark workflow</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="text-align:center">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="font-size:1.4rem">Don't trust us. Measure us.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal" style="margin:0 auto 24px">
        Clone the repo, run <code>./run.sh benchmark</code>, and compare on your own machine.
        That's the whole point.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal" style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={REPO} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Clone the repo</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`${BASE_URL}/download`}>Download Compass</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
